= Piłsudski criticises parliament

“[+ pl_crit_quote +]”

Józef Piłsudski again attacks the Sejm, this time over [+ pl_crit_topic +]. If we do not answer within three months, our silence will be remembered.

- @support
- @defend
- @reform
- @easy_discard

@support
title: Support the criticism of parliamentarism
subtitle: Costs this month’s action. Piłsudski and his followers in the party will appreciate it (+4), but the Centre will protest and the authority of the Sejm will weaken. [+ pl_crit_warning +]
choose-if: {! return PolishPolitics.criticismStatus(Q, 'support').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_crit_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishPolitics.criticismChoose(Q, 'support');
!}
go-to: result

@defend
title: Defend parliament and the lawful change of governments
subtitle: Costs this month’s action. The Centre will appreciate it and the authority of the Sejm will grow, but Piłsudski will move away from us (−4).
choose-if: {! return PolishPolitics.criticismStatus(Q, 'defend').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_crit_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishPolitics.criticismChoose(Q, 'defend');
!}
go-to: result

@reform
title: Parliament should be reformed to work better
subtitle: Costs this month’s action. It calms the Centre without provoking Piłsudski.
choose-if: {! return PolishPolitics.criticismStatus(Q, 'reform').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_crit_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishPolitics.criticismChoose(Q, 'reform');
!}
go-to: result

